	(text_box "Contract §5.7: CMD_HA, CMD_LA, CMD_HB, CMD_LB, RELAY_CMD, BTEST_CMD, WIN_OPEN, TEST_MODE: 100 k to GND here and Ioff buffers on BRIDGE_3V3 (SN74LVC2G17, Ioff <= 10 uA: the main controller's 3.3 V commands cannot power BRIDGE_3V3 when the\nrail is off). OC_DET_N, IDLE_I_DET_N: 100 k to GND here, so an open or unpowered sheet-13 comparator reads FAULT; buffered by an inverting SN74LVC2G14 (OC_F, IDLE_RAW high = fault). K_REST_N: no pull here (pull-up on 04); SN74LVC2G14\ngives K_AT_REST (= not K_REST_N) and K_LEFT (= K_REST_N).\nPairs share a package only where a double failure is harmless: (HA, HB) both stuck high cannot conduct without a low side; (LA, LB) are separated in time by the state machine; (WIN, TM) stuck high = test mode = patient relay blocked."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 579.585 31.75 0)
		(size 268.03 10.636)
