	(text_box "G_HA = HA AND RUN_H AND LA_OFF10: G_HA is blocked while G_LA is on and for 9-20 us after it goes off [CALC] (LA_OFF10: 10 k / 1.5 nF C0G charged at once through a BAS116 when G_LA rises, SN74LVC1G14). Same for G_HB against G_LB. The\nlockouts watch the gated enables, not the raw commands (review R-23).\nOutputs to sheet 13 through 1 k (pull-downs there). The high side may be enabled before a sequence (the 100 us lead): no current can flow without a low side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 867.935 208.913 0)
		(size 263.23 8.477)
