	)
	(text_box "START_OK = [NOT OC AND NOT idle current AND NOT FLT] AND [RDY AND WIN AND BR5_OK] AND [LB_LOCK AND MODE_OK].\nMODE_OK = shock mode: XFER (relay left rest, with K_EN on, for >= 10.0 ms) AND KWIN_N (coil on for less than 45.7-51.8 ms)\nOR test mode: TM AND K_AT_REST (patient relay at rest) AND BTOK (test relay enabled >= 2.08 ms).\nXFER: AND(K_LEFT, K_EN_I) -> 110 k / 100 nF -> TLV7031 at 0.640: 10.0-12.0 ms [CALC] (emptied at once through a BAS116 when either input drops). BTOK: BTEST_EN_I -> 36 k / 100 nF -> SN74LVC1G17: 2.08-4.35 ms [CALC].\nEvery intermediate node has a 100 k pull-down: a dead gate refuses the start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 590.175 401.54 0)
		(size 265.89 12.795)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
